# Multiplayer Future

Status: BLOCKED
Milestone: Post-vertical-slice research
Dependencies: Approved vertical slice and explicit product decision
Blocker: Local core gameplay, authority, performance, and scope are not yet proven.

## Purpose

Preserve future networking awareness without allowing networking to dominate the first slice.

## Deferred research

- [ ] Confirm required player count.
- [ ] Decide peer-hosted versus dedicated authority.
- [ ] Evaluate Unity networking options at that future date.
- [ ] Define state and command serialization.
- [ ] Define territory replication strategy.
- [ ] Define latency model for movement and spraying.
- [ ] Define prediction/rollback requirements.
- [ ] Define reconnect and host-loss behavior.
- [ ] Define anti-cheat expectations.
- [ ] Define matchmaking/account scope.
- [ ] Build a separate networking proof.

## Unblock criteria

- [ ] Vertical slice approved.
- [ ] Local movement and aim stable.
- [ ] Territory authority model accepted.
- [ ] Deterministic rule tests pass.
- [ ] Performance budgets met.
- [ ] Online multiplayer is explicitly prioritized over additional local content.

## Acceptance criteria

Not applicable until unblocked.

## Completion evidence

Blocked by design.

## Completion log

- 2026-08-18 - Created as intentionally BLOCKED to prevent premature networking implementation.

